# TPY Admin

Generated Vite + React admin dashboard for your tamilPY FastAPI backend.

## Structure

```text
admin/
  package.json
  vite.config.js
  index.html
  src/
    App.jsx                 # routes
    data/models.js          # generated from schema.tpy
    components/             # shared UI
    pages/                  # generic list + form pages
    api/client.js
```

## Run

```bash
# terminal 1 — API
tpy serve

# terminal 2 — admin UI
cd admin
npm install
npm run dev
```

Open http://127.0.0.1:5173

`package.json` overrides Vite's Rollup dependency to `@rollup/wasm-node`.
That avoids Windows Application Control blocking Rollup's native `.node` binary.

The admin app calls the FastAPI backend at:

```text
{{ api_base_url }}
```

Update `src/config.js` if your backend runs somewhere else.

## Regeneration

Running `tpy admin` or `tpy build --with-ui` again regenerates files in `admin/`
from `schema.tpy` (including `src/data/models.js`).
